{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eb903157-6eb9-4dd8-8710-2e428622c046","agentId":"a5695120b75e50fb2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 symmetry-aware Benders cut / 利用对称性强化 Benders cut 的方法。\n\n**背景：** Round 6 终末地 agent 发现项目 99% 对称性已破除（grouped encoding + signature monotonic）。但 Benders cut 本身能不能利用对称性？比如同型号设施 binding 失败的 cut，能否广播到所有同构候选？\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. Symmetry breaking + Benders 学术工作\n2. Symmetric LBBD / orbit-based cut\n3. CPAIOR/CP 论文 2024-2026\n4. ULD scheduling LBBD 的 symmetric cut（Round 5/6 提过）\n5. 对我们 binding/routing/flow cut 的应用\n\n输出末尾：\"具体实施方案\"。"},"uuid":"06c1e022-d62f-47a9-9577-e1853aadc8de","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:06:27.772Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
